# 统一换行符为 LF，匹配 Prettier endOfLine: lf，避免 Windows/CRLF 导致格式化抖动
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本例外：检出必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析 goto/label 可能出错
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
